sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Video Editor (User)
    participant UI as Prismex UXP Panel (React)
    participant PPro as Premiere Pro DOM (`ppro`)
    participant Core as Prismex Daemon (FastAPI/Engine)
    participant Extractor as FFmpeg Audio Service
    participant Transcriber as MLX / Groq Engine
    participant Aligner as Forced Aligner (CTC/DTW)
    participant Analyzer as Silence/Filler/Take Analyzers
    participant DB as SQLite Project Store

    User->>UI: Clicks "Magic Rough Cut" (or Analyze Sequence)
    UI->>PPro: Inspect activeSequence (tracks, items, mediaPaths, in/out)
    PPro-->>UI: Return SequenceManifest (name, fps, sampleRate, clipList)
    UI->>Core: POST /api/v1/jobs/magic-rough-cut (SequenceManifest, ProfileConfig)
    Core->>DB: Create Job record (status: INITIALIZING)
    Core-->>UI: Job Created (jobId: "job_01h...")
    
    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        note over Core,Extractor: Stage 1: Audio Extraction
        Core->>Extractor: Extract audio from source clips or sequence bounce
        Extractor-->>Core: High-fidelity mono 16kHz WAV generated in scratch cache
    end

    rect rgb(255, 250, 240)
        note over Core,Transcriber: Stage 2: Transcription & Alignment
        Core->>Transcriber: Transcribe audio (MLX-Whisper / Groq Whisper)
        Transcriber-->>Core: Raw transcript with segment timestamps
        Core->>Aligner: Force-align words with Wav2Vec2 CTC / DTW
        Aligner-->>Core: Microsecond-precision WordTimestamps[]
        Core->>DB: Persist Transcript & WordTimestamps
    end

    rect rgb(245, 255, 250)
        note over Core,Analyzer: Stage 3: Feature Detection Pipelines
        par Silence Detection
            Core->>Analyzer: Run Silero VAD v5 + Adaptive RMS
            Analyzer-->>Core: SilenceSegments[]
        and Filler & Stutter Detection
            Core->>Analyzer: Run regex dictionary + LLM speech hesitation detector
            Analyzer-->>Core: FillerDecisions[]
        and Repeated Take Analysis
            Core->>Analyzer: Detect duplicate sentences & score best takes
            Analyzer-->>Core: TakeGroups[] (recommended candidates)
        end
    end

    Core->>Core: Consolidate into Candidate Edits & Cut Decision List (EDL)
    Core->>DB: Save EditingSuggestions & CutPlan
    Core->>UI: WebSocket push: JOB_COMPLETE (ReviewQueuePayload)

    alt Mode: Magic Auto Edit
        UI->>PPro: Request Sequence Duplicate (`createCloneAction`)
        PPro-->>UI: New Sequence Created ("SequenceName_RoughCut")
        UI->>Core: POST /api/v1/timeline/apply-cuts (approvedCuts)
        Core->>UI: Return atomic TimelineActionSteps
        UI->>PPro: Execute SequenceEditor batch operations (ripples/splits)
        PPro-->>UI: Timeline updated successfully
        UI-->>User: Magic Rough Cut complete! (Report displayed)
    else Mode: Magic Review Edit
        UI-->>User: Render Review Queue (interactive preview, accept/reject chips)
        User->>UI: Review & approve/modify suggestions
        User->>UI: Clicks "Apply Approved Edits"
        UI->>PPro: Clone sequence & execute approved timeline operations
        PPro-->>UI: Sequence edited non-destructively
        UI-->>User: Editing applied & report saved
    end
